# Playground social links — copy this file to `.env` and fill in what you have.
#
# A link left empty (or removed) still shows its icon, but clicking it opens a
# "Coming soon" dialog instead of navigating.
#
# Only VITE_-prefixed variables reach the browser, and they are baked into the
# built JavaScript — fine for public profile URLs, never for secrets.
# On Netlify/Vercel, add the same variables in the site's environment settings
# and redeploy; `.env` itself is not committed.

VITE_SOCIAL_WHATSAPP=
VITE_SOCIAL_INSTAGRAM=
VITE_SOCIAL_FACEBOOK=
VITE_SOCIAL_YOUTUBE=
VITE_SOCIAL_X=
VITE_SOCIAL_LINKEDIN=
VITE_SOCIAL_GITHUB=
